  "_comment": "The dungeon: tombs beneath the temple. A held D pedal under shifting tremolo strings and a dim chord; the 'omen' cell crawls in the low bassoon and trombone; a dulcimer drips single eerie notes. Dread and space — no melody to hum, the texture is the fear.",
  "bpm": 84,
  "time_signature": [4, 4],
  "loops": 2,

